---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="About Christine A. | Author, Culinary Artist & Bible Teacher"
  description="Learn about Christine A.'s 30+ years of biblical study, journalism background, culinary training, and ministry vision behind CSA Online Shop."
>
  <Header slot="header" />

  <!-- Hero Header -->
  <section class="bg-[#0A1128] text-white py-20 border-b border-[#D4AF37]/30">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-full border-2 border-[#D4AF37] bg-[#0A1128] text-[#D4AF37] font-playfair font-bold text-2xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6 shadow-md">
        CA
      </div>
      <span class="text-xs font-montserrat uppercase tracking-widest text-[#D4AF37] font-semibold mb-2 inline-block">
        Author Profile & Story
      </span>
      <h1 class="font-playfair text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold mb-4">
        Meet Christine A.
      </h1>
      <p class="text-gray-300 font-montserrat text-sm uppercase tracking-wider font-medium">
        Author • Culinary Artist • Journalist • Follower of Jesus
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Narrative Content -->
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 lg:py-24 space-y-16">
    
    <!-- Intro Paragraph -->
    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-gray-700 leading-relaxed font-inter">
      <p class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-playfair text-[#0A1128] italic font-medium leading-relaxed border-l-4 border-[#D4AF37] pl-6 py-1">
        "I write because words have eternal consequence. In a digital world obsessed with quick monetization and superficial content, my purpose is simple: to anchor hearts in truth, nourish families around wholesome tables, and unveil the living beauty of Jesus Christ."
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 4 Pillars Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
      
      <!-- Pillar 1 -->
      <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 shadow-sm">
        <div class="text-[#D4AF37] font-montserrat uppercase tracking-wider text-xs font-bold mb-2">Pillar 01</div>
        <h3 class="font-playfair font-bold text-2xl text-[#0A1128] mb-3">30+ Years in the Scriptures</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
          My study of the Bible began not as an academic exercise, but as a deep hunger for absolute truth. Decades of researching ancient Hebrew types, Old Testament shadows, and the unbroken prophetic line have confirmed one reality: the Bible is a flawless, living masterpiece that points relentlessly to Jesus Christ.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Pillar 2 -->
      <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 shadow-sm">
        <div class="text-[#D4AF37] font-montserrat uppercase tracking-wider text-xs font-bold mb-2">Pillar 02</div>
        <h3 class="font-playfair font-bold text-2xl text-[#0A1128] mb-3">The Journalist’s Eye</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
          With a background in journalism, I approach writing with rigor, clarity, and respect for the reader's intellect. I do not believe in fluff, emotional manipulation, or empty spiritual buzzwords. My goal is to make profound truths clear, verifiable, and deeply engaging.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Pillar 3 -->
      <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 shadow-sm">
        <div class="text-[#D4AF37] font-montserrat uppercase tracking-wider text-xs font-bold mb-2">Pillar 03</div>
        <h3 class="font-playfair font-bold text-2xl text-[#0A1128] mb-3">The Culinary Artist</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
          Good food brings people together like nothing else on earth. As a trained professional culinary artist, I treat cooking as an everyday ministry of hospitality. My culinary works—like <em>20 Under 20</em>—are created for real life: quick, restorative, wholesome, and free from pretense.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Pillar 4 -->
      <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 shadow-sm">
        <div class="text-[#D4AF37] font-montserrat uppercase tracking-wider text-xs font-bold mb-2">Pillar 04</div>
        <h3 class="font-playfair font-bold text-2xl text-[#0A1128] mb-3">Scandinavian Inspiration</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
          Writing from Sweden brings a quiet, contemplative peace to my work. Surrounded by northern waters, silent pine forests, and unhurried skies, each book is forged in quiet prayer and unhurried thought.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- The 3 Ecosystem Sites Box -->
    <div class="bg-gray-100 rounded-2xl p-8 sm:p-10 border border-gray-300">
      <h3 class="font-playfair font-bold text-2xl text-[#0A1128] mb-3">Connecting The 3-Site Ecosystem</h3>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
        Whether you are reading devotionals, preparing dinner, or contemplating poetry, your experience is part of one unified vision:
      </p>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 text-xs font-montserrat">
        <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-lg border border-gray-200">
          <span class="text-[#D4AF37] font-bold block mb-1">01. Bookstore & Hub</span>
          <strong class="text-[#0A1128]">csaonlineshop.com</strong>
          <p class="text-gray-500 mt-1">Central catalog, blog essays & fellowship community</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-lg border border-gray-200">
          <span class="text-[#D4AF37] font-bold block mb-1">02. 75 Devotionals</span>
          <strong class="text-[#0A1128]">spiritualbooks.csaonlineshop.com</strong>
          <p class="text-gray-500 mt-1">Interactive multi-language audio & study reader</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-lg border border-gray-200">
          <span class="text-[#D4AF37] font-bold block mb-1">03. Poetry & Musings</span>
          <strong class="text-[#0A1128]">christinea.csatravellers.com</strong>
          <p class="text-gray-500 mt-1">Reflections, travel essays & contemplative verse</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <div class="text-center pt-8">
      <a href="/catalog/" class="inline-block px-8 py-3.5 rounded-lg bg-[#0A1128] text-white hover:bg-[#D4AF37] hover:text-[#0A1128] font-montserrat font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider transition-all duration-300 shadow-md">
        Browse Christine's Published Works
      </a>
    </div>

  </section>

  <Footer slot="footer" />
</BaseLayout>
